 R←Test_ReportAllIssues_010(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;rc;msg;stop;raw;data;filename;html;i;name
⍝ Regression test: every repo that has open issues must show up in the report.
⍝ Repos with just one or two of them used to be dropped silently.
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '∘∘∘ ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 stop←0
 (rc msg raw)←stop UCMD'ReportAllIssues aplteam -raw'
 →T.PassesIf rc=0
 data←,raw                          ⍝ Alternates "*** repo ***" and the issue matrix
 →T.PassesIf 0<≢data

 (rc msg filename)←stop UCMD'ReportAllIssues aplteam'
 →T.GoToTidyUp rc≠0
 html←∊⊃⎕NGET filename 1
 :For i :In {⍵/⍨(≢⍵)⍴1 0}⍳≢data
     name←4↓¯4↓i⊃data
     →T.GoToTidyUp~∨/name⍷html      ⍝ Every repo in the raw data belongs in the report
 :EndFor

 R←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 {}##.GitHub.FilesAndDirs.DeleteFile filename
⍝Done
